WEBVTT

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.360
Good morning!

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.860
Good morning.

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:12.110
Let's work hard again today!

00:00:12.710 --> 00:00:15.470
No, you're off for the day.

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:16.240
Huh?

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.580
Won't it be hard to be around 
yokai after yesterday?

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:22.170
Take the day off.

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:25.000
Okay.

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:32.880
I take it back!

00:00:32.880 --> 00:00:34.550
I'm not taking the day off!

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.440
You should.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:41.960
I won't! I'm going to work, 
even if I have to crawl there!

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:44.590
Why are you being so stubborn?

00:00:44.590 --> 00:00:46.390
Just take the day off.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:49.640
I won't.

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:50.690
What?

00:00:49.730 --> 00:00:50.690
<b>What?</b>

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:55.750
<i>No matter how unpleasant or scary or 
tough it is now, I have to stick it out.</i>

00:00:56.690 --> 00:01:01.220
<i>Honestly, I've been afraid to 
be around yokai since then.</i>

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:06.100
<i>If I take today off, I might be 
even more afraid tomorrow.</i>

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:10.000
I refuse to take today off.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:11.630
Just take the day off.

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:12.670
Huh?

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.200
You should take the day off 
work and come hang out with us.

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:19.550
Fusshi, I think you should make 
your invitation more specific.

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:20.640
You're right.

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:22.920
Ashiyan, Abenon.

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:25.140
Come on the photo club's overnight trip.

00:01:25.550 --> 00:01:26.790
Overnight trip?

00:03:00.400 --> 00:03:05.410
<b>Mystery 6 "The Seedling"</b>

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.960
It's this way!

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.830
Fuzzy, let's go!

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:15.960
Abeno-san, I found another one!

00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:17.960
I found one!

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:20.390
There are more here!

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:45.740
I almost squashed you, Fuzzy!

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:47.500
Sorry for scaring you.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:51.900
It seems you really can sense yokai now.

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:56.500
Yeah. I've been able to ever since 
the incident with the Executive.

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:01.590
But I have to focus and hold my breath.

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:04.010
What?

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:05.260
That's it?!

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:10.030
It's too dangerous if it 
makes you dizzy all the time.

00:04:10.030 --> 00:04:11.500
You should take time off.

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:15.240
It's Fusshi.

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:17.070
Answer it.

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:17.770
Hello?

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:19.910
I'll call the Mononokean.

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:24.140
I appreciate the invitation, but sorry.

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:26.030
I can't go on the overnight trip.

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:31.230
Abeno-san and I have work on 
those three days and two nights.

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:33.680
<i>I guess you can't help it, then.</i>

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:36.200
<i>I'll let Fuji-sensei know.</i>

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:38.620
Why don't we go?

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.140
Fusshi, one sec.

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:44.800
Abeno-san, what did you just say?

00:04:44.800 --> 00:04:46.730
Let's go on the overnight trip.

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:48.550
<i>I didn't mishear him!</i>

00:04:48.940 --> 00:04:51.040
Fusshi, I take back what I said.

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:54.200
Abeno-san and I will both be 
going. Please let us come!

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:57.060
Yeah. Send me the details later.

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:00.820
Why did you suddenly change your mind?

00:05:00.820 --> 00:05:03.370
We'll train on the trip so you can learn

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:07.680
to properly use your defective 
yokai-detecting abilities.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:10.140
Train on the trip?

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.910
I'll think of some way you can train.

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:17.020
I don't mind that it's defective...

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:17.420
<b>Huh?</b>

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:17.770
Huh?

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:20.340
I-I'll do my best, sir!

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:26.880
I'm off to play.

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:30.890
Yahiko?

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:47.030
<i>Will this be a training camp 
with the coach from Hell?</i>

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:53.070
Okay!

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:55.310
So this is where we'll be training.

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:58.430
This isn't a sports team training camp.

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:00.280
We won't be working out.

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:02.170
We're just taking pictures, right?

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:05.670
I brought disposable cameras for 
students who don't have their own.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:05.670
<b>Fuji-sensei</b>

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:07.660
You wind it and push the button?

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:08.880
It's analog...

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:11.970
That looks fun. Sensei, I want one.

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:15.180
Huh? Where's Abeno-san?

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:18.160
Pardon the intrusion!

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:19.810
Abeno-san, no fair having your own room!

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:20.740
Huh?

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:31.070
Ashiya, you didn't sense my 
presence at all, did you?

00:06:31.070 --> 00:06:32.410
Yahiko?

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.330
I win!

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:36.890
He rode on top of the bus the whole way here.

00:06:34.740 --> 00:06:36.100
Yahoo!

00:06:36.890 --> 00:06:38.170
Yahiko did?

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:39.610
He was suppressing his presence.

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:42.840
Seriously? I didn't notice at all.

00:06:42.840 --> 00:06:46.840
Yahiko, you shouldn't have followed us here.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:48.520
Zenko will be worried.

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:50.400
Huh? It's not like that!

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:53.600
I came to play hide-and-seek with you.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:57.080
With me? Which means...

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.600
Yahiko will be your training partner.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:00.600
What?

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:02.980
Yahiko will be "it."

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:07.730
Your job is to hide while detecting 
his presence and avoiding him.

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.830
Yahiko is good at controlling his presence.

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:13.620
Once you've learned to sense him,

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:16.780
you'll have mastered your 
detection abilities.

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:21.500
Also, relaxing your shoulders should 
make your dizziness go away, too.

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:23.750
So that's why Yahiko's the perfect choice.

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:26.990
Don't hold back, Yahiko.

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:29.740
Sure thing, you hunk of junk.

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:31.510
Do your best to hide.

00:07:31.870 --> 00:07:34.010
<i>He's the perfect opponent.</i>

00:07:37.600 --> 00:07:40.270
<i>The three-year-old versus 
the five-year-old...</i>

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:40.270
<b>3-year-old vs. 5-year-old</b>

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:43.270
I'm ready to go anytime!

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:45.630
We'll start looking for you in ten minutes.

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:48.400
And if I'm able to hide 
for an hour, I win, right?

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:51.240
How high do I count to get to ten minutes?

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:52.280
Six hundred.

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:54.780
<i>I think I can last an hour.</i>

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:56.880
Here I go!

00:07:56.880 --> 00:07:59.290
One, two...

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:02.180
What's up, Ashiya? Come take 
some photos with... us...

00:08:02.880 --> 00:08:04.540
He's already gone.

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:08.000
<i>I'll learn to sense Yahiko's presence</i>

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:11.660
<i>and improve my skills as an 
employee of the Mononokean!</i>

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:26.810
<i>Fuzzy is the only presence I detect nearby.</i>

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:28.360
When I'm not focusing,

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:31.570
I can barely even sense Fuzzy, 
and he's right next to me.

00:08:32.100 --> 00:08:35.270
But Abeno-san can sense 
them without even trying.

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:37.820
I should listen for footsteps, too.

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:39.800
I feel like a criminal on the run.

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:41.580
Found you!

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:48.260
Get up. Let's do it again.

00:08:56.530 --> 00:08:57.680
Huh?

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:00.700
I heard another animal 
roaring in the distance.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:02.930
Sounds a lot like Ashiyan, doesn't it?

00:09:03.420 --> 00:09:06.190
Yahiko's been finding you in no time at all.

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:08.620
You may suck at this, but can't 
you least get the hang of it

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:10.140
enough to hide for thirty minutes?

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:11.850
Hunk of junk!

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:13.580
<i>This fiendish duo...</i>

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:17.450
Anyway, Yahiko, no one asked you to 
make this a scary hide-and-seek game!

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:18.920
You get that for free.

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:21.580
I don't want any free add-ons!

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:24.600
That's enough for today. Let's head back.

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:26.460
Aww!

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:29.150
It's already late.

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:31.090
We'd better hurry back to the inn.

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:36.090
<i>Again...</i>

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:40.470
<i>Yahiko's been teasing me all day.</i>

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:42.850
<i>I wasn't able to sense him.</i>

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:46.090
It's still the first day.

00:09:46.090 --> 00:09:49.860
Tomorrow I'll do my best not to be 
found for at least thirty minutes!

00:09:50.260 --> 00:09:52.980
Wait, Abeno-san!

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:57.040
If he can't find me, buy me 
some ice cream, Haruitsuki!

00:09:57.040 --> 00:09:58.270
I have to buy it?

00:09:58.270 --> 00:09:58.870
Yeah!

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:11.290
You can't sleep here.

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:15.270
Yahiko, hairball, wake him.

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:17.500
Abenon!

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:21.480
Great timing. Could you take 
Ashiya back to your room?

00:10:21.480 --> 00:10:23.050
Ashiyan...

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:25.770
The inn offered to lend us some yukata.

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:28.890
Abenon and Ashiyan, let's go borrow some.

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:31.150
They don't have many, so it's 
first come, first served.

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:32.690
<b>Yukata (Kimono) = Familiar = Comfy</b>

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:36.400
First come, first served? I'll come.

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:39.070
What about Ashiyan?

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:42.330
He's asleep. I'll get one for him.

00:10:42.330 --> 00:10:44.810
Haruitsuki, I want a snack!

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:51.640
Wake up, trashboat! 
Haruitsuki said you're in the way!

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:52.920
Get up or I'll bite you!

00:10:54.870 --> 00:10:57.180
Yahiko, shut up.

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:01.800
Don't blame me if Haruitsuki 
yells at you later.

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:04.090
You'll pay for this during 
hide-and-seek tomorrow.

00:11:04.090 --> 00:11:06.500
I'll scare you even more than I did today.

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:10.190
Don't scare me.

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:12.540
I don't like scary things.

00:11:34.480 --> 00:11:35.880
<i>The Executive?</i>

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:41.540
<i>He's gonna kill me!</i>

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:45.510
I'm hungry. Let's go to the convenience store.

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:47.050
<i>This presence...</i>

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:17.000
A... sh-shiya...

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:20.760
Revert.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:27.760
Sorry.

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:30.720
Ashiya, I'm so sorry.

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:36.090
Please don't kill me.

00:12:37.410 --> 00:12:38.900
What are you talking about?

00:12:40.180 --> 00:12:44.910
You're the one who tried 
to kill me, Executive.

00:12:45.890 --> 00:12:46.910
Ashi...

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:49.480
<i>I'm scared.</i>

00:12:49.940 --> 00:12:51.740
<i>This human is scary.</i>

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:54.490
<i>If I don't obey him...</i>

00:12:56.360 --> 00:12:59.350
<i>He'll kill me.</i>

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.260
Get away from him!

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:08.680
You... Was that...

00:13:20.870 --> 00:13:23.940
Abeno-san? Yahiko?

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:32.700
Huh? Was I still half-asleep?

00:13:33.720 --> 00:13:36.200
<i>There's no way he'd be here.</i>

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:41.710
<i>Huh? What was I doing just now?</i>

00:13:42.080 --> 00:13:44.490
<i>Remember... Remember...</i>

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:45.720
Ashiya, do you...

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:48.230
know how to use your "influence," too?

00:13:49.150 --> 00:13:51.920
Influence? What's that?

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:55.730
The light that was surrounding 
your hands. It's—

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:57.460
No, wait.

00:13:58.840 --> 00:14:02.040
I'll tell you, but give me a second first.

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:04.780
Sorry, Yahiko. I—

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:12.240
I'm sorry for scaring you, too.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:24.070
Do you mind if we talk tomorrow?

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:27.370
First you'll have to tell me what happened

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:30.760
from the very beginning until 
I came back to the room.

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:34.720
Then I'll tell you everything tomorrow.

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:36.140
For today, just get some rest.

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:38.180
Okay.

00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:51.660
<i>Influence...</i>

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:55.240
<i>That's the same power Abeno-san used.</i>

00:14:56.110 --> 00:14:57.290
Don't kill me.

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:03.980
<i>I need to rest.</i>

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.160
<i>Croak?</i>

00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:29.620
Don't sneak up on me.

00:15:30.230 --> 00:15:32.570
I called out to you a bunch of times.

00:15:32.570 --> 00:15:36.170
That was an impressive 
blow to the solar plexus.

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:38.100
I think my stomach exploded.

00:15:39.110 --> 00:15:40.190
It sounds okay to me.

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:44.580
Damn it! Are you on 
Abeno-san's side, stomach?

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:48.300
Here's some of the café au lait 
you love so much. Drink up.

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.340
It's compensation from Abeno-san.

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:53.810
Ashiya, about yesterday...

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:55.770
Try using your influence again.

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:58.100
Right now?

00:15:58.100 --> 00:15:59.920
Recall how you felt when you thought

00:15:59.920 --> 00:16:02.350
you were going to be killed, the 
way you described yesterday.

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:06.440
<i>The same feeling as then...</i>

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:10.950
<i>The same... the same... the same...</i>

00:16:16.510 --> 00:16:19.020
You're not doing it. Try again.

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:20.070
Okay.

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:23.740
If you can't do it, that's fine.

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:26.540
As you're aware,

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:30.410
you can suppress yokai as strong as 
the Executive using your influence.

00:16:32.010 --> 00:16:34.180
The hairball and Yahiko are no exception.

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:39.420
But it involves suppressing the 
will and thoughts of yokai.

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:42.280
It's achieved by forcing them to be obedient.

00:16:42.680 --> 00:16:46.520
Depending on its strength or how you 
use it, it could even kill them.

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.080
Abeno-san...

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:53.920
Yesterday, while I was using my 
influence, I was acting unconsciously,

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:55.660
but I remember what happened.

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:59.910
If you hadn't come then,

00:17:00.690 --> 00:17:03.930
would I have killed Yahiko?

00:17:04.860 --> 00:17:07.190
Your influence is a double-edged sword.

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:10.680
It can be dangerous to yokai 
depending on how you use it.

00:17:11.110 --> 00:17:14.860
But depending on how you use it,
it can also be your strongest defense.

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:18.040
When you need to, you should 
use it without hesitation.

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:28.100
After you quit working for me, 
you'll have to protect yourself.

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:33.720
That said, it's pointless if 
you can't use it properly.

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:38.350
Is this something that 
requires training, too?

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:39.700
Hold your breath.

00:17:43.360 --> 00:17:45.590
Fuzzy? You're here?

00:17:46.380 --> 00:17:50.010
You really hadn't noticed him.

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:52.000
Before worrying about your influence,

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:55.450
you should focus on developing 
your miserable detection skills.

00:17:55.450 --> 00:17:56.730
We'll train more today.

00:17:56.730 --> 00:17:57.590
Okay.

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:15.860
We're playing hide-and-seek 
again today, right?

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:17.540
Thanks for helping.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.240
Sure.

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:24.200
Let's begin.

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:24.990
Okay.

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:28.120
Huh?

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:33.750
I found Ashiya!

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:46.730
<i>Yesterday I couldn't even stay 
hidden for thirty minutes,</i>

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:48.510
<i>but today I'm doing well.</i>

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:52.360
<i>Is it because of my training, 
or because of my influence?</i>

00:18:52.790 --> 00:18:55.130
I should focus on training right now.

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:58.360
I may be getting better, 
but it's still pretty wonky.

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:03.750
<i>He's still far away, but 
I can sense Yahiko's presence.</i>

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:16.000
<i>I'm learning to sense them now,</i>

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:20.130
<i>but that fear still hasn't disappeared.</i>

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:21.420
<i>And...</i>

00:19:21.420 --> 00:19:23.260
<i>It could even kill yokai.</i>

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:25.210
<i>Because of my influence...</i>

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:35.110
<i>The hairball and Yahiko are no exception.</i>

00:19:37.890 --> 00:19:40.310
I made you worry about me, too.

00:19:41.760 --> 00:19:42.870
It's okay.

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:46.410
Sorry for making you worry.

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:49.610
Yeah, it's okay.

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:01.420
<i>I can't believe I'm breaking 
under the strain now.</i>

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:05.690
<i>I'm glad Abeno-san and 
Yahiko aren't here, but...</i>

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:09.300
I feel a little relieved.

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:14.440
This place is so relaxing.

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:30.090
<i>Just now, over this way...</i>

00:20:30.980 --> 00:20:35.460
Relaxing your shoulders should 
make your dizziness go away, too.

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:38.890
I see! So this is what he meant!

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:42.470
Hey!

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:45.240
Abeno-san!

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:47.740
We're playing hide-and-seek, 
and he's coming toward me.

00:20:47.740 --> 00:20:49.600
That means Ashiya loses, right?

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:53.500
Abeno-san, Abeno-san!

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:56.490
I think I figured something out!

00:20:56.490 --> 00:20:57.160
What?

00:20:57.160 --> 00:20:59.550
<i>Based on his smug look, is he 
talking about his detection skills?</i>

00:20:59.550 --> 00:21:01.820
I detected a yokai and didn't get dizzy!

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:02.610
<i>I was right.</i>

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:05.610
So I'm okay now!

00:21:05.610 --> 00:21:08.970
Prove to me that you can do it before 
you go making any big claims.

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:11.790
<i>He doesn't think I'm okay at all!</i>

00:21:12.110 --> 00:21:14.750
Yahiko, put more effort into it this time.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.000
Got it.

00:21:16.930 --> 00:21:18.780
<i>He's been going easy on me?!</i>

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:26.010
<i>I couldn't spare a moment to think 
about anyone but myself before,</i>

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:30.520
<i>but did that incident not 
have any consequences?</i>

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:37.930
<i>Is Abeno-san okay?</i>

00:21:43.480 --> 00:21:46.280
Sorry for asking you to come over so late.

00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:48.780
I need you to deliver a message.

00:21:50.230 --> 00:21:53.270
It's about the Executive...

00:23:25.090 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Next Time: "The Dabbler"</b>

00:23:25.890 --> 00:23:29.010
Now that the training camp is over, 
it's time to enjoy my summer vacation!

00:23:29.010 --> 00:23:33.220
Or so I thought, until the Legislator 
paid us a visit and a ghost appeared!

00:23:33.940 --> 00:23:35.810
Next time, "The Dabbler."

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:37.850
I doubt I'll be able to enjoy it now.
